        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gov-note" value="When enabled, all agent memory traffic is mediated by the governor instead of going straight to Honcho: POST /admit (write) and POST /plan-retrieval (read). With every flag off, /admit returns &quot;disabled&quot;, /plan-retrieval returns enabled=false, and callers keep Honcho-native context." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#6B7886;fontSize=9;spacingLeft=2;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
