        <mxCell id="dec-router-d" value="1. resolve persona/role → tier (PERSONA_TIERS_JSON)&#10;2. if gpt4o-mini over daily budget → downgrade to phi4&#10;3. build fallback chain (fit context); try primary tier&#10;4. on failure/over-budget, walk the chain:&#10;     Foundry tiers → gpt4o-mini → phi4 (phi4 required)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#42505E;fontSize=9;spacingLeft=2;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="790" y="616" width="272" height="88" as="geometry" />
